OL,3,AJapan sends up jets after alleged
OL,4,ARussian incursion of its airspace
OL,5,
OL,6,FJapan says it launched fighter jets and
OL,7,F"strongly" protested after two
OL,8,Fsuspected Russian aircraft violated its
OL,9,Fairspace early on Tuesday.
OL,11,FSouth Korea also says it deployed
OL,12,Ffighter jets, while Taiwan says it
OL,13,F"responded" to Russian military
OL,14,Faircraft detected in their respective
OL,15,Fair defence identification zones.
OL,17,FThese are unofficial buffer areas
OL,18,Fbeyond territorial airspace where
OL,19,Fgovernments identify approaching
OL,20,Faircraft for security purposes. Moscow
OL,21,Fhas yet to comment.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
